Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.28,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.77,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad to be here.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.44,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.91,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.84,0:01:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.84,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.04,0:01:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody and I destroyed the Control Spire in\NAustralia with a little help from Santa,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.34,0:01:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who was actually Hogan,\Na friend of Geni's.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We saw a down-under\NDigidestined kid named Derek
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.40,0:01:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,windsurfing and being\Nchased by some bad Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.46,0:01:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a Gokimon, Armadimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.52,0:01:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Crabmon got rid of them before\Nthey became the Blue Flare special.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile in Paris, TK and\NTai, along with TK's grandpa,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,found the Mamemon brothers holding a French\NDigidestined girl, Catherine, hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.58,0:01:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They rescued her, but not before\Ntaking a pie or two in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.86,0:02:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm allergic to meringue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.14,0:02:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.05,0:02:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Viva la France!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,0)\fscx100\fscy100\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(318,320)}The Fierce Battle of Love and Borscht!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.58,0:02:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Purity! Portiski!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.66,0:02:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Direct hit!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.56,0:02:15.98,date 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\c&HF1F6EF&\pos(322,155)}2002/12/24 10PM, Acapulco, Mexico
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.56,0:02:15.98,date 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\c&HF1F6EF&\pos(326,357)}(25th 1PM in Japan)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.14,0:02:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.34,0:02:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this size?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it a monster? Is it a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.76,0:02:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.60,0:02:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Howling Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.26,0:02:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spiking strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.64,0:02:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Hey, Matt! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The renegade Digimon are trying to hide\Nin the Mayan ruins to the east of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.72,0:02:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better get over there before\Nthey take the place apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good plan. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.42,0:02:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are the Mexican Digidestined?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.30,0:02:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought they were supposed to meet us.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.06,0:02:55.44,date 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,0)\pos(322,323)}Palenque, Mayan Ruins
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have a curfew for kids here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.46,0:02:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's four of us to how many of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.10,0:02:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like those odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.74,0:03:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody said it would be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll even the odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.87,0:03:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait until those guards get a\Ngood look at you and Wormon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.82,0:03:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.74,0:03:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I will go in first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon can sneak behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let us by.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.83,0:03:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think my little sister's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.16,0:03:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how dumb do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little pumps just want to\Nget in there and tag the ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.94,0:03:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tag the ruins? Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.84,0:03:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need for an\Ninternational incident here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.68,0:03:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that is a little spooky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.22,0:03:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.13,0:03:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.52,0:03:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The direct approach didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.24,0:03:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There has to be another way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.42,0:03:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.63,0:03:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but first, Ken, what did that guard\Nback there say to make you so angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.12,0:03:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's enough of Ken to go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.90,0:03:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's not forget why we're here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.56,0:03:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a time when that\Nwould have been a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.58,0:03:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Times have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.70,0:03:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, for the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.28,0:04:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much for sneaking in the back door.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.80,0:04:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not taking any chances here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.78,0:04:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's already crawling with Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.90,0:04:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ironic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.81,0:04:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thing I'm here, eh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.08,0:04:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, my manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Jose, Gennai's Mexican counterpart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.14,0:04:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure know how to\Nmake an entrance, Jose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.18,0:04:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great timing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.09,0:04:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you help us get inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.50,0:04:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch, I've been waiting\Nfor a captive audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.76,0:04:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.26,0:04:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hola!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.44,0:04:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buenas noches, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am José the Magnificent,\Nat your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.36,0:04:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he expect money?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.68,0:04:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.92,0:04:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.83,0:04:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I read somewhere that there's an\Nancient king buried in these ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.26,0:05:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, maybe we'll see his ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.06,0:05:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that be cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.95,0:05:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that is a little spooky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just tripped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.23,0:05:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, because it's dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dark, and you could get hurt, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I'm so smart it scares me. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes you scare me, too, but I\Nthink it's for a different reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.82,0:05:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.73,0:05:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may be a goofy little glow worm,\Nbut that light was a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.22,0:05:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geniuses are always misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.94,0:05:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agatsuman, what's he doing here all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.98,0:05:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.94,0:05:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.85,0:05:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to take you\Nback to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.52,0:05:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.24,0:05:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hola, buenas noches.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.30,0:06:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, I mean, buenas noches.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.48,0:06:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Rosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm double glad I sneaked\Nout of the house to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.54,0:06:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.64,0:06:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She must be one of the\NMexican Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.18,0:06:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She seems kind of young to be one of us,\Nbut then again, she seems pretty brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.28,0:06:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, this crazy little guy\Nis your Digimon partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my name is Ken, and these are my friends,\NMatt, Gabumon, and my partner, Wormon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.84,0:06:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.50,0:06:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you hold my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.98,0:06:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does she think she's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.78,0:06:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what she said, but\Nit's pretty clear what she's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.68,0:06:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a rude little girl. I'm what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.20,0:06:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need for an\Ninternational incident here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.26,0:06:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's enough of Ken to go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.78,0:06:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's not forget why we're here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.06,0:06:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.98,0:06:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.00,0:06:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, are you ready? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.42,0:06:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.44,0:06:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gusano! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.44,0:06:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.35,0:06:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.70,0:07:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ken, what did Rosa just call him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.66,0:07:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fishby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.57,0:07:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'd tell\Nhim that if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.36,0:07:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.48,0:07:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She could at least insult me\Nin a language I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.24,0:07:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're warning next time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.22,0:07:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence, is this your idea of sneaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.22,0:07:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, we're on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's just young.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.58,0:07:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Ken, do you have a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.44,0:07:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't, maybe you can move here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.64,0:07:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I could be your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think I'm cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.42,0:07:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who does she think she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.28,0:07:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think that is what matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.02,0:07:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What matters is what she wants to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.58,0:07:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just call her Rosa Ichijoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormon would rather bite off his\Nown tongue than call her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.74,0:07:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that up ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I'll bet it's trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.40,0:07:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Minotauramon and Dokugumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.38,0:07:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, and they're\Nnot at all happy to see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, these ruins are a\Nvaluable historical site.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.94,0:07:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't fight in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.94,0:07:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.85,0:07:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.77,0:08:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need a way to get them outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Outside, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.45,0:08:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.37,0:08:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.02,0:08:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a ring in your nose\Nor an allergic reaction?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.62,0:08:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are pretty good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.42,0:08:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.46,0:08:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Rosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.88,0:08:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.98,0:08:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darkseid, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop him. Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.68,0:08:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.62,0:09:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.76,0:09:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.78,0:09:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.90,0:09:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nigi-Ball is your champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.12,0:09:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's my Nigi-Ball too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.40,0:09:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.64,0:09:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon, these ruins are the last\Nwill and testament of the Mayans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.18,0:09:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to leave them in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I'm not a barbarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.99,0:09:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never should have doubted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.98,0:09:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I thought you had\Na hard hit, Gotsumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't even seem to\Ncare that we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.98,0:09:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can bring them to their senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.40,0:09:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's use Azulonmon's power. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:09:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Howl away, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.10,0:09:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.18,0:10:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.44,0:10:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.29,0:11:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NIGIGIGIMAN!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.59,0:11:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.51,0:11:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatsuma, Digimon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.42,0:11:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monochromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.98,0:11:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monochromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.58,0:11:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had just about enough of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.38,0:11:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now is our chance, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.04,0:11:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send them back. My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digiport, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.34,0:11:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.00,0:11:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Night-night. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.76,0:11:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon, it's my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.30,0:11:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even when she's asleep, she's mean to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.94,0:11:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.10,0:11:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She just said, Stingmon,\Nyou're the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.54,0:11:56.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.18,0:11:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor girl, she's exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better get her home to her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.48,0:12:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Delirious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.66,0:12:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rosa, ¿eres tú?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.74,0:12:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.65,0:12:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rosa, don't you have any\Nidea how worried we've been?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were just about to call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.12,0:12:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever were you thinking,\Njust wandering off like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.72,0:12:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.63,0:12:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my goodness, you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.00,0:12:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ken, how do you say "thank\Nyou" in Spanish? Gracias.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.56,0:12:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gracias, Rosa.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.51,0:12:33.10,date 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(190,0)\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(320,198)}2002/12/25 7AM, Moscow, Russia
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.51,0:12:33.10,date 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(190,0)\pos(322,236)\c&HFFFFFF&}(25th 1PM in Japan)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.04,0:12:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's finish this. I'm\Nhungry. Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shadow Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:12:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glide Horn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.56,0:13:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so where do we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.96,0:13:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.44,0:13:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.38,0:13:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Sonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.66,0:13:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.92,0:13:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That went well. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.00,0:13:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.48,0:13:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Yoli, this is Sora, and these two...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.38,0:13:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Biyomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.54,0:13:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Hawkmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.10,0:13:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.84,0:13:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Sonia, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.58,0:13:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuri, Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.48,0:14:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon and Hawkmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.42,0:14:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirana, Sora, and Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.16,0:14:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuri, Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon, Hawkmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.38,0:14:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.54,0:14:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't the others have this problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.44,0:14:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just lucky, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we can't understand each other's\Nwords, we're all still Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.93,0:14:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's try it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.68,0:14:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to tell Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.59,0:14:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Genie's friend or whatever he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.44,0:14:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.35,0:14:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.30,0:14:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one with the purple\Nhair is kind of cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.58,0:14:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rightio, on to plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.24,0:14:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't have a plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.22,0:14:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd better come up with one\Nunless you can read their minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.02,0:14:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll happen when pigs fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.64,0:14:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it. It is? We'll fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.16,0:14:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See the Flymon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.86,0:14:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of our Digimon can fly too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.78,0:14:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.16,0:14:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fly, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.36,0:14:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, just attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.42,0:14:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack from the air. Attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.58,0:15:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just like charades.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.30,0:15:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is, but in a different language.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will find a way to make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.68,0:15:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.10,0:15:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think they understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.54,0:15:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only get so far with body language.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.86,0:15:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so helpless, but\Nthe only Russian I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.36,0:15:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you know some Russian words?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.96,0:15:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, peruski and borscht.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.18,0:15:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terrific, so you're in charge of\Nordering for us in a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I caught it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.68,0:15:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I say peruski, you fly to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.04,0:15:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then when I say borscht,\Nyou fly to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.92,0:15:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And caviar means we attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unorthodox, but it just might work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.32,0:15:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to give it a try!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.24,0:15:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anna, Sonia, Yuri, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.84,0:15:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.66,0:15:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peruski! Borscht! Caviar, OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.32,0:15:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.54,0:15:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Air Force, full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.12,0:15:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were born to give orders, Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:15:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.68,0:16:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nelly Sting! Brewski!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.52,0:16:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nelly Sting! Air Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.70,0:16:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caviar!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.96,0:16:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy Shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shadow Sickle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scissor Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.28,0:16:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast Laser!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.30,0:16:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoenix claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.56,0:16:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, it's working, but\Nlet's watch while we're flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye-aye, General Inoue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.93,0:16:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digidestined rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.82,0:16:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, borscht and caviar!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.12,0:16:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grisky and caviar
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.18,0:16:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's send these guys\Nhome. Digi-port, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.06,0:16:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great job
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.50,0:17:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't need a translator to explain\Nthat We may not understand each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.36,0:17:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but growling tummies are\Nuniversal If I don't eat soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.84,0:17:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pass out. I will, too. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.82,0:17:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I think she means periski.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.98,0:17:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And borscht?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.88,0:17:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, what is borscht?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me it's lunchtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.56,0:17:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or dinner or breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.68,0:17:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.64,0:17:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to have seconds and thirds\Neven before I've had my firsts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.68,0:17:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for being late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lunch ran long. I'm Ilya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're all ready to get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.48,0:17:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.39,0:17:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about lunch, Ilya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you I just finished\Nnow about your assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.22,0:17:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are desperately needed in Siberia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.26,0:17:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I liked Gennai better when he was old.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:18:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't have sent us\Nto Siberia without lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.52,0:18:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he wasn't even there when\Nwe needed him to translate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.12,0:18:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes me so mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.80,0:18:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe that'll keep you warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast rings!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.22,0:18:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wings out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.13,0:18:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fast pressure!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.50,0:18:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.80,0:18:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my, my hands are so\Ncold I can hardly hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.66,0:18:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's awful, the girls will freeze\Nif we don't get this over with!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.74,0:18:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sub-zero ice punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so cold, I can't\Ntell if I'm still here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.44,0:18:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare fall asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo-Li, you'll fall off! Pho?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.68,0:18:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's hard, Yo-Li,\Nbut we have to hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.70,0:18:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just think about Peruski and Yuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toss Crusher!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.98,0:18:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.24,0:18:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caught you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.86,0:18:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sora, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.74,0:18:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.72,0:19:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imperialdramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.48,0:19:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you expecting, Santa Claus?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.84,0:19:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great timing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.04,0:19:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you like drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.86,0:19:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ilia!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.77,0:19:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.82,0:19:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These fellows will be\Nhome in time for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.94,0:19:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fiji port open!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.56,0:19:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was nice meeting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.14,0:19:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two are very resourceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.02,0:19:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lesser girls than you would have\Ncrumbled like a stale brewski.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.20,0:19:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Ilia. Keep busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.28,0:19:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright then, let's go grab Kari\Nand Izzy in Hong Kong and head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need a serious nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, we can't go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.76,0:19:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost Christmas morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.26,0:19:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we're not home in time\Nto open our presents,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.92,0:19:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our parents are going to get suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.86,0:19:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I wanted peruski, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.82,0:19:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with an\Nold-fashioned rice ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.82,0:19:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Yuri was taking us to dinner. Yuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.94,0:19:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everybody, let's get out of\Nhere before the eyelids freeze together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.32,0:19:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you found out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.56,0:20:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I regret to inform you, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.90,0:20:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that we don't know any more now\Nthan the last time you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish there was more to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.88,0:20:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time we find something promising,\Nit disappears before we can open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.36,0:20:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy's very clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.92,0:20:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to all a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.08,0:20:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to be a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.54,0:21:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your most delicious\Nplan yet, my diabolical darling!
