Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.60,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.44,0:21:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to make me\Nfeel like I'm in the same way.
